  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p> Your unsportsmanlike opponent punches you in the throat, causing your windpipe to spasm and close, momentarily cutting off your airways.</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (1). Once removed the @Condition[Stunned] Condition is replaced by @Condition[Fatigued] (1), as usual, except you’ll gain another @Condition[Fatigued] Condition each subsequent turn until you reach @Condition[Fatigued] (3) at which point you’ll remove all @Condition[Fatigued] Conditions on your next turn as your throat recovers and you can breathe again.</p>"
    },
